{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The race of the millennium is about to begin.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millennium Runners is the ultimate anti-gravity racing experience: <strong>speed beyond all limits, adrenaline-fuelled circuits and four racing teams ready for anything to win the Millennium Cup. </strong>In this remote future, where speed is synonymous with power and the racetrack is the battleground, only the best will join the legend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on adrenaline-pumping challenges at incredible speed, dominate the corners with breathtaking manoeuvres and make your mark on galacting racing history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limitless Speed</strong> - Experience the thrill of top speed with a smooth and responsive driving system.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iconic Circuits</strong> - Race on breathtaking tracks on remote planets, through vertical cities, magnetic storms and futuristic environments.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Legendary racing team</strong> - Choose from four unique teams, each with their own advanced technology and racing philosophy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iconic soundtrack</strong> - Every corner, every overtake, every explosion has its own beat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THREE GAMES MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race: challenge 5 AI opponents, use boosts and power-ups and cross the finish line before anyone else!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Attack: run extraordinary race times to earn medals.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Last Ship Standing: every 30 seconds the last one is eliminated. Be the last standing in the race!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The future of racing is here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582420?t=1744988999","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/2b96a44880de1a2cb1a505717b11b5840c143818/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744988999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/01d44c130b36d689296b59f7b91e8ae2e64df2b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744988999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582420/01d44c130b36d689296b59f7b91e8ae2e64df2b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744988999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The race of the millennium is about to begin.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millennium Runners is the ultimate anti-gravity racing experience: <strong>speed beyond all limits, adrenaline-fuelled circuits and four racing teams ready for anything to win the Millennium Cup. </strong>In this remote future, where speed is synonymous with power and the racetrack is the battleground, only the best will join the legend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on adrenaline-pumping challenges at incredible speed, dominate the corners with breathtaking manoeuvres and make your mark on galacting racing history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limitless Speed</strong> - Experience the thrill of top speed with a smooth and responsive driving system.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul cl